# =====================================================================
# Release V069 -- Targets-only rebuild job (Gold.usp_Load_Targets)
# =====================================================================
# A single SP to rebuild the target facts after a new Input.Targets load,
# WITHOUT a full Bronze->Gold build. Runs the 3 target-fact loads in
# dependency order (Fact_Targets -> Fact_Effective_Targets -> Fact_Daily_Targets;
# Effective reads Fact_Targets so order matters).
#
# Usage after loading targets (Load_Targets_From_Template.py):
#   1. EXEC Gold.usp_Load_Targets @Mode='PROD';   -- rebuild the target facts
#   2. Refresh the semantic model 'DM Dentally'    -- so the report shows them
#
# Run: .\Scripts\Deploy.ps1 -Manifest Releases\V069__load_targets_job.manifest -SkipTests
# =====================================================================

DEPLOY  Fabric\Gold.usp_Load_Targets.StoredProcedure.sql

TEST
